---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Ahmed Hossam, software engineer, open source contributor, curious about how things work."
>
  <div class="content-shell about-page">
    <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>

    <div class="about-body">
      <p>
        I'm Ahmed Hossam, a software engineer at the Open Transit Software
        Foundation, where I work on
        <a href="https://github.com/OneBusAway" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OneBusAway</a>,
        an open source transit project that helps millions of riders every day
        get to work, see their families, and get where they need to go.
      </p>

      <p>
        I first joined OneBusAway through Google Summer of Code in 2024. I kept
        contributing after that and eventually joined the team, where I've been
        working ever since. In 2026 I also took on a GSoC mentor role, helping
        new contributors find their footing the same way I once did.
      </p>

      <p>
        Most of my work is around backend systems, APIs, open source, and lately
        a lot of Go. I like understanding how things work, especially when
        something makes me genuinely curious. When that happens, I tend to go
        pretty deep: reading, building, breaking things, asking questions, and
        trying again until it makes sense.
      </p>

      <p>
        This site is mostly a place for that. I write about software, things I'm
        learning, projects I'm working on, and things I notice. I also write
        about my interests, life, philosophy, and whatever else happens to be on
        my mind.
      </p>

      <p class="explore-label">A few links to explore:</p>
      <ul class="explore-list">
        <li><a href="/writing">Writing</a></li>
        <li><a href="/projects">Projects</a></li>
        <li><a href="/now">What I'm doing now</a></li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Elsewhere</h2>
      <p>You can receive updates from me via email or follow me:</p>
      <ul class="elsewhere-list">
        <li>
          <span class="elsewhere-label">RSS feed</span>
          <a href="/rss.xml">ahmedhossam.me/rss.xml</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="elsewhere-label">Email</span>
          <a href="mailto:ahmedhossamdev1@gmail.com">ahmedhossamdev1@gmail.com</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="elsewhere-label">X</span>
          <a href="https://x.com/Ahmedhossamdev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@Ahmedhossamdev</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="elsewhere-label">GitHub</span>
          <a href="https://github.com/Ahmedhossamdev" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@Ahmedhossamdev</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="elsewhere-label">Bluesky</span>
          <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/ahmedhossamdev.bsky.social" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@ahmedhossamdev.bsky.social</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="elsewhere-label">LinkedIn</span>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ahmedhossamdev/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">/in/ahmedhossamdev</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding-block: 3rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--heading);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .about-body {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .about-body p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .about-body h2 {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--heading);
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.625rem;
  }

  .about-body ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.375rem;
  }

  .explore-label {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem !important;
  }

  .explore-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding-left: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.375rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .explore-list li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .elsewhere-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .elsewhere-list li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 6rem 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .elsewhere-list li::before {
    display: none;
  }

  .elsewhere-label {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }
</style>
